Package: KITE
Title: Kiel Institute Trade Policy Evaluation Model
Version: 26.05.0.9000
ReleaseName: Balmy Cumbuco (Flatwater)
Date: 2026-05-12
Authors@R: c(
    person("Julian", "Hinz", role = c("cre","aut"),
           email = "julian.hinz@kielinstitut.de"),
    person("Hendrik", "Mahlkow", role = "aut",
           email = "hendrik.mahlkow@kielinstitut.de"),
    person("Joschka", "Wanner", role = "aut",
           email = "joschka.wanner@kielinstitut.de"))
Description: An R package implementing the Kiel Institute's general equilibrium
    trade policy evaluation model. Multi-sector Ricardian framework with
    intra- and international input-output linkages; supports simulation of
    trade policy changes via tariff and non-tariff measure scenarios.
